And [38;5;10mAdd[0m does [38;5;10mstate[i][j] ^= RoundKey[i][j][0m. So [38;5;10mstate[0][0] ^= rk[0][0] = 0x2b[0m, [38;5;10mstate[0][1] ^= rk[0][1] = 0x7e[0m, etc.[0m[0m
